      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-298591",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/8c/8cee91e9e50007e0f3b9a812e3a48dfe867f6dc2808294080ab32a239ff62bc3.png)\n\nTwo groups of elementary school students participated in a summer reading challenge. Team Gold recorded a median of $5$ books read. The histogram above shows the number of books read by members of Team Silver.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe median number of books read by Team Silver is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nTeam Silver\u2019s median is\n{{field-2}}\nTeam Gold\u2019s median.\n\nA comparsion of the medians suggests\n{{field-3}}\nread more books on average."
